WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:09.650
<b>Part 2</b>

2
00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:16.522
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Hassan walks for five days through the mountains.

3
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:21.222
The sun shines. At night, it’s very cold.

4
00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:26.991
Then, one evening, he arrives at a rich and beautiful palace.

5
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.053
The prince in the palace welcomes him.

6
00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:35.644
He gives him food and drink, and Hassan sleeps in a comfortable bed.

7
00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:41.181
There is one strange thing – the windows have no glass.

8
00:00:42.035 --> 00:00:44.991
The next day, Hassan says goodbye.

9
00:00:45.507 --> 00:00:50.670
He wants to thank the prince and give him something, but he only has his

10
00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.893
empty water bottle. He gives it to him.

11
00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.617
The prince is very surprised.

12
00:00:57.186 --> 00:01:06.231
‘What’s this?’ he says. ‘I can see through it! It’s beautiful! It’s wonderful!’

13
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:12.088
He is very happy, and in return he gives Hassan a box.

14
00:01:12.694 --> 00:01:16.059
‘Don’t open it until you get home,’ he says.

15
00:01:16.237 --> 00:01:20.385
‘And be careful with it. It’s very valuable.’

16
00:01:21.418 --> 00:01:24.053
Hassan walks through the mountains again,

17
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.489
and after five days he arrives home.

18
00:01:28.058 --> 00:01:31.637
Walid and their mother watch him open the box.

19
00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:38.331
He finds 100 gold coins inside. His mother is very happy!

20
00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:43.014
‘Hassan, you clever boy!’ she says.

21
00:01:43.245 --> 00:01:46.575
‘Now we can buy food and clothes!’

22
00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:50.385
The next night, Walid makes a plan.

23
00:01:51.026 --> 00:01:56.046
‘100 gold coins in return for a glass bottle,’ he thinks.

24
00:01:56.509 --> 00:02:03.755
‘If I give the prince my mother’s silver ring, perhaps I can get 1,000 gold coins!’

25
00:02:04.361 --> 00:02:09.773
So Walid gets up, goes very quietly into his mother’s room,

26
00:02:09.969 --> 00:02:13.067
and takes her ring from a box under her bed.

27
00:02:13.975 --> 00:02:20.242
The next morning he asks his brother where the palace is, and he leaves.